qlcplus (5.3.1) stable; urgency=low

 -- Massimo Callegari <massimocallegari@yahoo.it>  Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:47:15 +0200

qlcplus (5.3.0) stable; urgency=low

  * qmlui: sync color tools with fixture selection and highlight current colors (#2181)
  * qmlui: improve 3d rendering of multi-head color changers (e.g. T-Bars)
  * qmlui: fix TreeModel::removeItem() swallowing recursive removal failures
  * qmlui: keep the Function tree in sync with renames made elsewhere
  * qmlui: fix crash when opening a function editor while another of the same type is shown
  * qmlui: fix relative movement of mixed 3D items selection
  * inputprofiles: add M-VAVE SMC-PAD (thanks to Cristian Deluxe)
  * qmlui: fix video editor open (#2158)
  * qmlui: add Lime, Indigo, RGBL and RGBA to channel wizard
  * webaccess: improve keypad parsing
  * qmlui: improve drag from fixture group manager
  * qmlui: fix Del key press on text edit items
  * engine: fix and optimize RGBMatrix values update
  * qmlui: make preset tool window floating
  * qmlui: add preset tool edge snapping and fix palette preview
  * qmlui: improve timing tool for beat-based Show (#2151)
  * qmlui: improve Show manager header time/beat markers
  * qmlui: fix moving a time-based show item in a beat-based show (#2150)
  * qmlui: handle drag & drop of project/fixture files on the main window
  * qmlui: improve beat-based Shows (#2147)
  * qmlui: remember VC Cue List columns width
  * qmlui: fix high-resolution wheel zoom in 2D view
  * qmlui: fix VC widget background color + picture not saved correctly
  * qmlui: allow to select a different plugin feedback line
  * qmlui: persist 3D View "Show FPS" setting across view switches
  * qmlui: improve 3D view zooming
  * qmlui: in 3D view do not select an item with mouse right button
  * qmlui: improve CTRL+A shortcut handling
  * qmlui: improve show items pointer handling
  * qmlui: handle multiple output plugins configuration
  * qmlui: handle Show item track move and undo/redo on remote
  * qmlui: restored XYPad EFX size control
  * qmlui: fix virtual console page detach
  * qmlui: handle remote client automatic access grant
  * qmlui: add VCCueList side fader live action to Tardis
  * engine: improve loading of definitions without modes
  * qmlui: improve remote project loading and packets integrity check
  * qmlui: support concurrent native client sessions
  * qmlui: improve once again 3D scene reset
  * qmlui: handle Script stopOnExit(false) properly
  * qmlui: XYPad handles groups and introduce tracking mode
  * qmlui: add input control and pan & tilt adjust to Scene Editor
  * resources: assign prev/next page to input profiles
