  * qmlui: add an option to show fixture group buttons in 2d/3d view
  * qmlui: improve universe summary layout and print quality
  * qmlui: allow to lock/unlock 3d view generic items
  * qmlui: do not send feedback from another frame page (#2080)
  * qmlui: improve VC widget input sources removal
